00:03:58.837 --> 00:04:01.380
- Yeah, I mean it's, it's probably,

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:03.150
I'd say it's like a third thing.

00:04:03.150 --> 00:04:04.050
So, it's not...
- Yeah.

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:07.350
- It's, it's based on Anne Rice's novels,

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:11.610
but it's, it's based on like
all 18 of Anne Rice's novels.

00:04:11.610 --> 00:04:13.170
So, it has like, the,

00:04:13.170 --> 00:04:16.530
the movie came out before
she'd written them,

00:04:16.530 --> 00:04:18.900
