00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:26.699
Yeah.

00:04:26.699 --> 00:04:27.532
- Were you always into like, I,

00:04:27.532 --> 00:04:28.365
we were literally sitting here going,

00:04:28.365 --> 00:04:29.200
