00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:30.780
So, I'm so excited.

00:04:30.780 --> 00:04:32.640
Like, were you excited?
Do you like vampire stuff?

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:33.900
- I love vampire stuff.

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:34.733
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:04:34.733 --> 00:04:36.280
- I love being a vampire,
I've got like teeth.

00:04:36.280 --> 00:04:37.309
- [Kelly] Of course, yeah.

00:04:37.309 --> 00:04:38.340
