00:04:48.893 --> 00:04:50.190
And I was like, "No, no, no, I like them".

00:04:50.190 --> 00:04:51.300
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:52.180
- [Jacob] Yeah...

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:53.013
- It, it made me feel like,
kind of like a vampire,

00:04:53.013 --> 00:04:54.090
I like them.
