- "Witches of Eastwick"?
- Yeah.

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:32.430
Do you know when she's, the cherry pips?

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:33.263
Or is it...
- Yes!

00:05:33.263 --> 00:05:34.754
Or something in the, yes.

00:05:34.754 --> 00:05:35.847
I love "Witches of Eastwick".

00:05:35.847 --> 00:05:38.670
- No, you might have just changed my life,

00:05:38.670 --> 00:05:41.893
